@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:但那也只是<br>她出示的证物，<br>现在门锁坏掉了<br>没办法检查<br>是不是真的钥匙……<br><br>|#0102Trial10_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……无论如何，<br>都没有证据支持<br>吾辈是凶手的假说。|#0102Trial10_AnAn005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"因为如果当时<br>门没有上锁，<br>那<link=\"Objection_01_02_10_01\">谁都能进房间</link>，<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_10_02\">也能杀害她</link>。<br>其他人也都能<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_10_03\">伪造声音</link>。|#0102Trial10_AnAn006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:所以<br>再讨论下去<br>也只是浪费时间。<br>……因为吾辈<br>不是凶手。|#0102Trial10_AnAn007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


